      "spam": false,
      "value": "I would say just have it be friends only able to collide with each other etc. it’d be too difficult and annoying to have different settings.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-04-12T18:52:28.429Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This would be a VRC version of the Dynamic Bone Colliders with options to interact with other players depending on friends status. So there will be a dropdown menu with 3 options.\n - 1: Public (Think of ears and tail)\n\n - 2: Friends Only (think about weapons or other things you don't want just everyone messing with)\n\n - 3: Selective: (this would require an option in the profile page of your friend you want to allow. This would add a checkbox to allow for these type of interactions for given friend)\n\nAbove the drop down menu add a little \"Intractable\" option to disable or enable it all and you're set. However ToS apply. No Luwd stuff allowed on public colliders and they disabled in public lobbies.\n\n (additional options could include a link to the mature content checkbox on avatar upload for disabling colliders all together, or simply adding this option to the collider. Another thing could be Friends plus as a 4th option.)",
